Dear Alex,

Aldermoor Health Trust invites your company to tender for the Aldermoor Patient & Referral
Portal. The Trust runs three hospitals (Aldermoor General, St Brannoc's and Fenwick
Community Hospital) and serves about 450,000 registered patients.

What we are buying:

- A patient portal (web and mobile web) where patients see their upcoming outpatient
  appointments, confirm, cancel or rebook them, read clinic letters and complete
  pre-appointment questionnaires.
- A referral and booking service for GP practices and our own clinicians, replacing the
  paper and fax referrals we still receive for about 30% of outpatient activity.
- Integration with our electronic patient record (CarePoint EPR), so appointments, letters
  and referral status stay in step with the record.
- Appointment reminders by SMS and email.

Industry: Healthcare (acute hospital trust). Products we expect to see: patient portal,
e-referral service, EPR integration (HL7 FHIR), notifications.

The discovery call is booked for Thursday 22 October. Our CIO Owen Hartley, clinical
safety officer Dr Leah Okafor and outpatients manager Sam Whitlock will join.

Please reply with a draft estimate and your assumptions by 20 November 2026.

Kind regards,
Priya Natarajan
Head of Digital Procurement, Aldermoor Health Trust
